<title>GERMANY: Buderus to sell unit to Britax.</title>
<headline>Buderus to sell unit to Britax.</headline>
<dateline>WETZLAR, Germany 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German heating and appliance group Buderus AG said on Monday that it would sell its aircraft components unit Buderus Sell GmbH to U.K. group Britax International Plc for 205 million marks.</p>
<p>Buderus said in a mandatory bourse statement that it expected the sale to have a positive impact on its net profit in the 1996/97 business year.</p>
<p>The deal still must be approved by Britax shareholders.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
